    "domainId": "iam",
    "task": "Policy evaluation",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A user has an identity-based policy that allows s3:*, but an SCP denies s3:DeleteObject. A bucket policy also allows s3:* for the user. Can the user delete objects from the bucket?",
