    "explanation": "When the connection state is FAILED, AWS KMS displays a connection error code in the console and adds it to the DescribeCustomKeyStore response. These error codes help you troubleshoot the specific issue (e.g., invalid credentials, unreachable endpoint, authentication failures). AWS provides detailed documentation for interpreting and resolving connection error codes.",
