    "domainId": "infrastructure",
    "task": "Network controls",
    "type": "single",
    "stem": "A company is enabling IPv6 in their VPC. Private subnet instances need outbound IPv6 internet access but must NOT accept inbound connections from the internet. What should they deploy?",
